# Engine Court (CIPlay engine_court): the court at 4 m round 0 0; the outer ring (plate, Teo, crank, screechers), the
# middle ring (Hedda, locker, crank), the inner ring (Ines, the drone in two phases, its log, the keypad with a wrong code
# first, the inner crank), the housing (status, source, three ways, REACTIVATE - the other levers then refuse - the
# verdict, the gift), the goodbyes, the well stair; the treasure.
island Engine Court
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Concord Engine
expect hidden verdict_re
expect hidden gift_re
zone outer_ring
expect step 1
read Concord plate
expect step 2
read Teo's watch
expect step 3
use middlecrank
expect step 3
use outercrank
expect hidden outergate
expect step 4
kill Screecher
expect animals Screecher 0
expect step 5
zone middle_ring
expect step 6
read Hedda's watch
expect step 7
open Crew locker
wait 3
expect step 8
use middlecrank
expect hidden middlegate
expect step 9
zone inner_ring
expect step 10
read Ines's watch
expect step 11
zone drone_bay
expect step 12
# (a play's kill skips the phase: on.defeat gives both story items)
kill Caravan screecher
wait 3
expect story dronehurt 1
expect story dronedown 1
expect step 14
read Drone log
expect step 15
use innercrank
expect step 15
code courtpad 1111 wrong
code courtpad 3581
expect step 16
use innercrank
expect hidden housinggate
expect story inner 1
expect step 17
zone housing
expect step 18
read Engine status
expect step 19
read The source
expect step 20
read Three ways
expect step 21
use lever_re
expect shown verdict_re
expect shown gift_re
expect hidden verdict_off
expect hidden gift_off
expect story reactivateway 1
expect step 22
use lever_off
expect story shutdownway 0
read The verdict
expect step 23
open Engine's gift
wait 3
expect step 24
read Ines's goodbye
expect step 25
read Hedda's goodbye
expect step 26
read Teo's goodbye
expect step 27
zone courtcave
open Chalk cave chest
wait 3
expect step 28
read Builders' day book
expect step 29
code builderpad 247 wrong
code builderpad 358
expect story builderscode 1
expect step 30
open Builders' strongbox
wait 3
expect step 31
zone well_stair
dig
expect done
